# ── Credentials that must never reach this repository ────────────────
# The app has no build step, so a stray .json here is far more likely to be
# a downloaded service-account key than source. The VAPID private key and
# the Firestore Admin key both live in GitHub Actions secrets instead.
serviceAccount*.json
*service-account*.json
*-serviceaccount*.json
firebase-adminsdk*.json
firebase-adminsdk*.pem
*.pem
vapid*.txt
vapid*.key
SECRETS*.txt
*DO-NOT-COMMIT*
